WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:09.300
Review the learner record
Check the learner identity, programme, owner and onboarding status. Overview brings together contact details, programme information, contacts and notes.

2
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:16.800
Review enrolment answers
Show wizard opens the learner's enrolment form. Check the correct learner and delivery type before editing. Return here with Close wizard.

3
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:25.000
Documents and signatures
For apprenticeship learners, Documents contains compliance paperwork, reviews and uploads. Check document status and signatures before issuing or signing anything.

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:33.200
Skills and progress
Skills & progress brings together recorded competencies and course progress. Use the available training-plan actions to review or build the learner's plan.

5
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:41.319
Activity and completion
Activity shows the recorded history. Finish enrolment is a separate action: review the required information and document status before completing it.
